<title>USA: Ambanc moves to NASDAQ national market.</title>
<headline>Ambanc moves to NASDAQ national market.</headline>
<dateline>VINCENNES, Ind. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambanc Corp said Wednesday it has moved to the Nasdaq National Market from the Nasdaq Small Cap market.</p>
<p>The change was effective Wednesday, the bank holding company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
